<title>THAILAND: SOCCER-KING'S CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KING'S CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of matches in four-nation</p>
<p>King's Cup soccer tournament at Bangkok's National Stadium on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Sweden 3 Thailand 1 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Sweden - Gary Sundgren 68, Joakim Persson 82,</p>
<p>Robert Steiner 90</p>
<p>Thailand - Sasom Pobprasert 88</p>
<p>Third place play-off</p>
<p>Japan 2 Romania 0 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Hisashi Kurosaki 65, Masayuki Okano 86</p>
</text>
